# Optional: ./deploy-agent.sh --env-file=./deploy-agent.env
# Preferred: flags (script writes this file).
# Full guide: README.md at repo root.
#
# Part B — After Connected (UI Steps 1–4):
#   1. Install → Refresh → CONTROL_SERVER_LISTEN_PORT
#   2. ./deploy-agent.sh -t … -e … -m … -p <PORT>
#   3. Customer registrations (agent-svc:5004)
#   4. Resources → name this tenant → agent#https → base_url from Connect tab dial
#
# TENANT_NAMESPACE derived as <TENANT_ID>-<ENVIRONMENT_ID first 26 chars> if unset.

# TENANT_NAMESPACE=<TENANT_ID>-<ENVIRONMENT_ID first 26 chars>
TENANT_ID=<TENANT_ID>
ENVIRONMENT_ID=<ENVIRONMENT_ID>
X_ABLV_PRINCIPAL=<LOGIN_EMAIL>
CONTROL_SERVER_LISTEN_PORT=<CONTROL_SERVER_LISTEN_PORT>
